Subject: [PATCH 2/3] inventory: taxonomy v1 (114 leaves, reviewable CSV) and
 whole-token lookup for claim class

- app/data/taxonomy_v1.csv: id, group, claim_class, bulk, high_value, aliases; lifespan and price source left empty, reviewed=0 for a professional to fill
- services/taxonomy.py: whole-token longest-alias match, head-noun tie-break, built-in/freestanding modifiers
- classify_claim_class now delegates to the taxonomy; fixes outdoor/door, filing cabinet, hair trimmer
- tests: 36 cases
